Membership is invariant under the state/law cut, since the predicate and $\pi_0$ see only the joint $(\Omega_t, \theta)$. So the intro's first declaration ("which variables are its state and which its law") overstates what membership rests on: it rests on which variables the world comprises. The cut fixes the labels: the two warrants, (g), and the floor split. The Epistemic Status attributes the cut's non-observability to the housing result, which re-declares the whole state rather than the cut. "Stays the same along the whole run" wants "a.s.". 07 §2.6.

